25","quote":"始皇既沒，余威振於殊俗。然而陳涉甕牖繩樞之子，甿隸之人，而遷徙之徒也。材能不及中人，非有仲尼、墨翟之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富也。躡足行伍之閒，俛仰仟佰之中，率罷散之卒，將數百之眾，轉而攻秦。斬木為兵，揭竿為旗，天下雲會響應，贏糧而景從，山東豪俊遂并起而亡秦族矣。"}],"rationale":"限明示名、字及局部軍事角色；陳勝涉、吳廣叔、蔡賜房君與周文周章暫接，吳廣韓廣分開。引文四君短稱及比擬人物另留候選，詐稱扶蘇項燕不合陳吳，褚賈署稱不補姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p025","text":"始皇既沒，余威振於殊俗。然而陳涉甕牖繩樞之子，甿隸之人，而遷徙之徒也。材能不及中人，非有仲尼、墨翟之賢，陶朱、猗頓之富也。躡足行伍之閒，俛仰仟佰之中，率罷散之卒，將數百之眾，轉而攻秦。斬木為兵，揭竿為旗，天下雲會響應，贏糧而景從，山東豪俊遂并起而亡秦族矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"8sb_tti_0yc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"陳涉","kind":"person","person_id":"t9r_yzu_a41","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"anb_y7b_x61","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"墨翟","kind":"person","person_id":"7s1_uqc_cgq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"陶朱","kind":"person","person_id":"mgj_ry7_2x5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m025-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"猗頓","kind":"person","person_id":"ltv_hb9_iam","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-048","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-048","source_id":"s-shiji-048-chenshe","source":{"title":"史記／卷048","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷048","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷048&oldid=2531218","revision_id":2531218,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"26段史文；前20段篇文，後6段明署褚先生曰及所引賈生文字另分層，排除註釋版導覽與2個dd。","imag